	ui.heading(3, "Where styles come from"),
	ui.text("Modifiers produce inline styles, which cover most layout and colour work. Anything selector-based — a hover state, a checked sibling, a pseudo-element, a media query — belongs in a stylesheet, and this project's is written entirely in Caja: rule()/media() for element, combinator and attribute selectors, class()/variant() for the common single-class case, joined by stylesheet() into dist/style.css (main.caja does exactly this; the Site tab above documents the full API)."),
